hen picking them up f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T10:02:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035766","verified_at":"2026-10-23T10:38:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5123900-1846651706695497","game_id":"steam-5123900","kind":"update","title":"🧸 Demo Patch #1 ~ Fixes & Improvements","summary":"Hello everyone! 🧸❤️A small patch is already here, just one day after the demo launch!I mentioned to quite a few people that we'd aim to release a patch on Wednesday or Thursday, but personally, I wanted to make sure everyone could have the best experience possible as soon as possible.Quite a few people reported that the motion blur made the game unplayable for them, and others experienced some optimization issues. So, we worked hard to address these issues and get a patch out as soon as possible","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T14:24:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695497","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:48:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5123900-1846651706691333","game_id":"steam-5123900","kind":"announcement","title":"Pack a Plush! Demo Available Now!🧸","summary":"Pack a Plush! DEMO IS AVAILABLE NOW! 🧸 I'll try to make this post a little more personal, because this is a really special moment for me.After more than 10 years of making games, my colleague and I have poured so much love into Pack a Plush! We wanted to create a game that we would genuinely enjoy playing ourselves. And honestly, I might be a little biased since I made the game, but I also love playing it! 🥹So this is one of those moments where I can look at what we've created and feel genuinely","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691333","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:48:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5123900-1846651706677850","game_id":"steam-5123900","kind":"announcement","title":"New Pack A Plush! Steam Page & Release Date Trailer!","summary":"🧸 Pack a Plush! has a new Steam page!The Steam page has been updated with a brand-new release date trailer, updated screenshots, new updated description, and some new GIFs to give you a better look at what awaits you!📅 Releasing October 28th — International Plushie Day!But you don't have to wait until then to get all plushie! The demo arrives this Monday, so you can already start collecting, organizing, and building your very own plushiespace. 💖A huge thank you to everyone who's been supporting ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T14:02:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706677850","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:48:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5123900-1846018067943776","game_id":"steam-5123900","kind":"announcement","title":"Pack a Plush! is coming to Steam Next Fest! 🧸","summary":"Pack a Plush! is coming to Steam Next Fest! 🧸 Hello everyone!We're excited to share that Pack a Plush! is coming to Steam Next Fest next Monday, October 19! The full game launches just over a week later, on Wednesday, October 28! And yes, that's also International Plushie Day. Another reason to celebrate! ;)Your demo progress will carry over to the full game, so you can keep building your cozy plushie paradise without starting over! The demo does have some limitations, but you won't lose any of ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T11:42:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067943776","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:48:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5123900-1846018067926468","game_id":"steam-5123900","kind":"announcement","title":"Pack a Plush! is coming on international plushie day! 🧸","summary":"Pack a Plush! is available soon! 🧸We’re finally ready to announce that we have a release date for Pack a Plush! And there’s no better date for it than International Plushie Day: October 28th! ❤️We’ve been working a lot to get everything ready for the full release (and a demo), and we can’t wait for you to see what we’ve been cooking.🎬 A new trailer is coming soon!We’ll also have more exciting news to share about a demo soon, so keep an eye out for more updates! ^_^Thank you to everyone following","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T15:08:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067926468","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:48:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5123900-1843481262689023","game_id":"steam-5123900","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome to Pack a Plush! 🧸","summary":"Welcome to Pack a Plush! 🧸Hello everyone!Pack a Plush! is a cozy organizing and collecting game where you buy batches of adorable plushies, organize them into displays, discover rare plushies, and build your very own collection! 🐻✨We're a team of 2 developers trying to create a game for all the plushie fans out there. We really liked the idea of having a cozy organizing game where you can just enjoy collecting a whole bunch of adorable plushies!And there's a lot more exciting stuff coming to the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T13:27:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262